# ==============================================================================
# PACKAGE-SCOPED ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION (HARD RULE)
# ==============================================================================
# Each package in this monorepo maintains its own isolated .env configuration.
# Do NOT put environment variables here in the root directory.
#
# Please configure environment variables in each respective package directory:
#   - Backend:   packages/backend/.env.example   → packages/backend/.env
#   - Frontend:  packages/frontend/.env.example  → packages/frontend/.env
#   - Extension: packages/extension/.env.example → packages/extension/.env
# ==============================================================================
